# docs/DOCUMENTATION_INDEX.md is generated by scripts/build_index.py, one row per
# document. Every branch that adds a document inserts a row, and git treats two
# adjacent insertions as a conflict -- which cost three manual resolutions in a
# single day, none of them a judgement call.
#
# `union` keeps both sides' lines instead of conflicting. The result may be out of
# order for a moment; build_index.py regenerates deterministically and fixes that,
# and the `docs` job fails if anyone forgets to run it. A generated file should
# never be hand-merged.
docs/DOCUMENTATION_INDEX.md merge=union
